                                                "snapshots": {}
                                            }
                                        },
                                        "type": "std::string",
                                        "value": "<div><font size=\"+1\"><b>Gain</font></b><br><font color='#949495'>Mid-centered gain transformation applied to the elevation\nvalues. This is a non-linear recurve operator centered around\nthe mid elevation (typically 0.5). Increasing the gain pushes\nvalues toward the minimum and maximum elevations, creating\nflatter low/high regions with a steeper transition around the\nmidpoint.</div>"
                                    },
